# Studio frontend build-time config (Vite only exposes VITE_*-prefixed vars).
#
# VITE_BACKEND_URL — the backend origin the built app calls. Leave UNSET for
# local dev (BASE='' + the Vite dev proxy in vite.config.ts forward to
# localhost:8000). Set it for a production build where the API is on a different
# origin, e.g.:
#
#   VITE_BACKEND_URL=https://api.example.com
#
# The backend must allow this frontend's origin via ALLOWED_ORIGINS and, for the
# session cookie to be sent cross-subdomain, set COOKIE_DOMAIN=.example.com and
# COOKIE_SECURE=true. fetch() already uses credentials:'include'.
# VITE_BACKEND_URL=
